 "sentences": {
  "7": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.59b.8",
   "sugya": "shabbat_59b_ir_shel_zahav_kelila",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_shma_mina_r_afes",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "שמע מינה -- since the visitor is Levi, R' Afes must have died and Levi, without R' Chanina to sit with outside, came here",
     "supports": "p_nach_nafshei_r_afes",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_gavra_hu_levi",
     "gloss_en": "Rav: who is a great tall man who limps? Levi"
    }
   ]
  },
  "8": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.59b.9",
   "sugya": "shabbat_59b_ir_shel_zahav_kelila",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_rebbi_yeshev_barosh",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "דכי הוה קא ניחא נפשיה דרבי אמר: חנינא ברבי חמא ישב בראש",
     "supports": "p_r_chanina_lo_sagi_dlo_malich",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_vetigzar_omer",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "וכתיב בהו בצדיקים: ותגזר אומר ויקם לך -- what a righteous man decrees is fulfilled",
     "supports": "p_r_chanina_lo_sagi_dlo_malich",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_dilma_nach_nafshei_r_chanina",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "ודילמא נח נפשיה דרבי חנינא, ורבי אפס כדקאי קאי, ולא הוה ליה איניש ללוי למיתב גביה וקאתי להכא? -- perhaps it was R' Chanina who died, and Levi, left without a companion, came here",
     "against": "p_nach_nafshei_r_afes",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_levi_mikaf_kayif",
     "gloss_en": "אם איתא דרבי חנינא שכיב -- לוי לרבי אפס מיכף הוה כייף ליה: had R' Chanina died, Levi would have submitted to R' Afes",
     "answers": "obj_dilma_nach_nafshei_r_chanina",
     "restores": "p_nach_nafshei_r_afes"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_r_chanina_malich",
     "gloss_en": "ותו, דרבי חנינא לא סגי דלא מליך -- R' Chanina had to reign, by Rebbi's deathbed word and Job 22:28 (= p_r_chanina_lo_sagi_dlo_malich)",
     "answers": "obj_dilma_nach_nafshei_r_chanina",
     "restores": "p_nach_nafshei_r_afes"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_chanina_yeshev_barosh",
     "gloss_en": "Rebbi, when dying: Chanina son of R' Chama sits at the head"
    }
   ]
  },
  "10": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.59b.11",
   "sugya": "shabbat_59b_ir_shel_zahav_kelila",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_safra_talit_muzhevet",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "מידי דהוה אטלית מוזהבת -- a woven kamra is like a gilded cloak",
     "supports": "p_kamra_dearukta",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_kamra_shri",
     "gloss_en": "[going out with] a kamra is permitted"
    }
   ]
  },
  "11": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.59b.12",
   "sugya": "shabbat_59b_ir_shel_zahav_kelila",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_safra_avnet_melachim",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "מידי דהוה אאבנט של מלכים -- a metal kamra is like the belt of kings",
     "supports": "p_kamra_deaniskha",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_kamra_deaniskha",
     "gloss_en": "and some say: [the kamra permitted was one] of metal"
    }
   ]
  },
  "0": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.59b.1",
   "sugya": "shabbat_59b_ir_shel_zahav_kelila",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_kedavad_r_akiva",
     "gloss_en": "...like the one R' Akiva made for his wife"
    }
   ]
  },
  "1": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.59b.2",
   "sugya": "shabbat_59b_ir_shel_zahav_kelila",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_ir_lo_tetze",
